# SCENARIO: fix_120_walkpause_observed   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: auto
# Fix #120 - the observed-tier walk pause gets its roll when a walk BECOMES observed (not only at
# issue, which is usually off-screen), and pinned bots get fresh per-route pause caps per route.
# DEBUG MODE (run after `reload debug,<5 names>`): same geometry as baseline B1 -- 5 pinned bots
# ping-ponged with `goto` along x=32369 (y 32203<->32233) and y=32215 (x 32351<->32389) through the
# player's view at (32371,32218); every leg starts ~15 tiles out, i.e. off-screen. 12 rounds = 60 legs.
# Run: runner.py fix_120_walkpause_observed.steps --var W1=.. --var W2=.. --var W3=.. --var W4=.. --var W5=..
# Spec (config.lua): observed 12%*wb/15 per walk, wb<=3 never, 0.5-20 s, cap 8 per route;
# unobserved 2%, 0.4-5 s, cap 3; only IDLE/DWELLING/TRAVELING.
# Baseline (2026-11-18, bl_b1): 30 legs past the player -> 2 pauses, both `unobserved`, 0 observed;
# and a pinned bot could pause at most 8+3 times for the whole session (caps never reset).
# Acceptance (server truth, audit walkpause; each walkpause record now has at=issue|midwalk):
#   - >= 1 `tier=observed` pause (expected ~4 in 60 legs; P(0) ~ 2%);
#   - >= 1 `tier=observed at=midwalk` (the new path: decided on the tick the walk came into view);
#   - 0 pauses in HUNTING / COMBAT / PK_ATTACK / FLEEING;
#   - cap reset (read from the records, not asserted): per bot, pauses keep appearing after its 8th
#     observed one, and nThisRoute restarts at 1 after each goto.
@srv audit kinds walkpause,state,cmd,pathout,census
@srv audit watch $W1
@srv audit watch $W2
@srv audit watch $W3
@srv audit watch $W4
@srv audit watch $W5
@srv audit on expect="enabled=on"
@srv audit mark "F120 start"
@srv cmd "$W1" teleport 32369,32205,7
@srv cmd "$W2" teleport 32369,32231,7
@srv cmd "$W3" teleport 32352,32215,7
@srv cmd "$W4" teleport 32389,32214,7
@srv cmd "$W5" teleport 32369,32210,7
@p1 login
@p1 goto 32371,32218,7 range=2 stuck=15 timeout=120
@srv cmd "$W1" goto 32369,32233,7
@srv cmd "$W2" goto 32369,32203,7
@srv cmd "$W3" goto 32389,32214,7
@srv cmd "$W4" goto 32351,32215,7
@srv cmd "$W5" goto 32369,32233,7
@p1 hold 40 watch=$W1,$W2,$W3,$W4,$W5
@srv cmd "$W1" goto 32369,32203,7
@srv cmd "$W2" goto 32369,32233,7
@srv cmd "$W3" goto 32351,32215,7
@srv cmd "$W4" goto 32389,32214,7
@srv cmd "$W5" goto 32369,32203,7
@p1 hold 40 watch=$W1,$W2,$W3,$W4,$W5
